; Lancet's needles: one node in the arena that carries every needle in flight and every strike, in fixed pools, and draws
; them itself in cells on the world's 2 px grid (scripts/Lancet.cs). No collision shape - a needle homes on the body it was
; thrown at and strikes it on arrival - and no art: the needle, its bead of poison, the strike, the outright kill's cut and
; Bloodletting's spray are drawn in code. Speed is how fast a needle flies; NeedleLength how long it is drawn.
